# skillopt-sleep.manifest — 部署清单
# 源:  scripts/skillopt-sleep/
# 标:  /root/.hermes/skillopt-sleep/
# 格式：每行一个匹配模式，!开头表示排除

# === Include ===
**/*.py
**/*.md
**/*.yaml
**/*.yml
**/*.toml
**/*.txt
**/*.svg
**/*.png
**/*.html
**/*.json
**/*.sh
LICENSE
SECURITY.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
README.md
pyproject.toml
requirements.txt
index.html
mkdocs.yml
skillopt.html

# === Exclude ===
!**/__pycache__/**
!**/.git/**
!**/data/**